       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\nIbuprofen 1600 mg four times daily comes to 6,400 mg/day. That is twice the usual maximum for adults in a monitored setting (3,200 mg/day), and four times the OTC maximum of 1,200 mg/day. At that level the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury and cardiovascular events go up sharply.\n\nWhich of these did you intend?\n- **400 mg PO four times daily** (1,600 mg/day)\n- **600 mg PO four times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO three times daily** (2,400 mg/day)\n- **800 mg PO four times daily** (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n- **1,600 mg/day** in some other split\n\nIf you really do want 1600 mg four times daily, tell me and I'll enter it with a note saying the dose was intentionally confirmed. I'd still advise against it."
